  "solution": "Given:\n\n3 + (1 + (1)/(2) - {3 - (8 ÷ 2)} + (1)/(3) + (2)/(5))\n\nConcept used:\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/36648f6d9fd5d1d56959b630c72b514ab488f27d2525de3370bb428cc41cf8e9.png] \n\nCalculation:\n\n3 + (1 + (1)/(2) - {3 - (8 ÷ 2)} + (1)/(3) + (2)/(5))\n\n⇒ 3 + (1 + (1)/(2) - {3 - 4} + (1)/(3) + (2)/(5))\n\n⇒ 3 + (1 + (1)/(2) + 1 + (1)/(3) + (2)/(5))\n\n⇒ 3 + {30 + 15 + 30 + 10 + 12} over 30\n\n⇒ 3 + 97 over 30\n\n⇒ (90 + 97) over 30\n\n⇒ (187)/(30)\n\n∴ The simplified answer is (187)/(30).",
